# Review ownership. GitHub requests a review from the owners of every path a pull
# request touches.
#
# The point of the specific entries below is not bureaucracy: they are the files
# where a mistake is silent. A regression in routing produces an error somebody
# notices; a regression in redaction, in the audit record, or in metric
# cardinality produces nothing at all until it is expensive.

* @sluice-gw/maintainers

# The security-critical core. A change here needs a second pair of eyes even when
# it looks trivial.
/internal/redact/         @sluice-gw/maintainers @sluice-gw/security
/internal/audit/          @sluice-gw/maintainers @sluice-gw/security
/internal/gateway/        @sluice-gw/maintainers @sluice-gw/security
/SECURITY.md              @sluice-gw/maintainers @sluice-gw/security

# Money. Pricing and budget arithmetic is the other thing that fails quietly.
/pkg/llm/pricing.go       @sluice-gw/maintainers @sluice-gw/security
/internal/policy/         @sluice-gw/maintainers

# Supply chain and release surface.
/.github/                 @sluice-gw/maintainers
/Dockerfile               @sluice-gw/maintainers
/go.mod                   @sluice-gw/maintainers
/go.sum                   @sluice-gw/maintainers
